    "description": "Classic 3-unit Victorian in prime Castro/Eureka Valley location. Discover the timeless charm of this well-maintained 1908, 3-unit Victorian located in the heart of the Castro District! This is a tenant-occupied property with classic architectural details. The main level features (Unit 31 1/2) a 1-bed/3 room apartment in front (month to month lease), and a 1-bed/3 room apartment with a split bath (12-month lease). Upstairs, the top-level unit is full floor, with a large 3-bed/6 room layout with skylight and split bath (month to month lease). The ground level includes a 1-car garage, three secure storage areas, and a versatile open space potentially for an ADU addition. The owner has been fastidious with maintenance, and recently replaced 3 gas water heaters, the sewer line, and a new roof in 2018, plus the exterior repainted less than 2 years ago. The backyard is private with towering palm trees and a large 2-level wood deck. This property is in a prime location, offering easy access to public transportation, shopping, and the vibrant Castro neighborhood. Fully rented with rental income at $109,590/yr, this property is a fantastic investment. Purchase is subject to tenant's rights."
  },
